## 2. The REST client (fetches the thousands of records)

```java
// service/SalesApiClient.java
@Service
public class SalesApiClient {

    private final RestClient restClient;

    public SalesApiClient(RestClient.Builder builder,
                          @Value("${sales.api.base-url}") String baseUrl) {
        this.restClient = builder.baseUrl(baseUrl).build();
    }

    public List<SalesRecord> fetchSalesData(String from, String to) {
        return restClient.get()
                .uri(uri -> uri.path("/sales")
                        .queryParam("from", from)
                        .queryParam("to", to)
                        .build())
                .retrieve()
                .body(new ParameterizedTypeReference<List<SalesRecord>>() {});
    }
}
```

